{
  "slug": "shopify-devkit",
  "name": "Shopify Devkit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Scaffold Shopify Online Store 2.0 themes, generate Liquid sections, scaffold Shopify Functions and checkout extensions, and audit themes for performance and security.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**, **2 agents**, **3 commands** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `admin-api-query` (Generate an idiomatic Shopify Admin API GraphQL query or mutation with cursor pagination, fragments, and the correct permissions), `checkout-ui-ext` (Scaffold a Shopify checkout UI extension with extension.toml and src/Checkout.jsx), `liquid-section` (Generate a Liquid section for a Shopify Online Store 2.0 theme with a settings schema, blocks, and presets…), `shopify-function` (Scaffold a Shopify Function (product discount, cart transform, delivery customization, or payment customization) in Rust or JavaScript), `theme-audit` (Audit a Shopify theme for render-blocking Liquid, missing asset_url filters, direct output of user data without escape, oversized…), `theme-init` (Scaffold a Shopify Online Store 2.0 theme directory with the full folder layout (assets, config, layout, locales, sections,…)\n- **Agents** (2): `liquid-author` (Use when the user needs Liquid written or reviewed for a Shopify Online Store 2.0 theme), `shopify-function-author` (Use when the user needs a Shopify Function written, reviewed, or debugged)\n- **Commands** (3): `dev` (Start the Shopify app dev server with automatic port-conflict recovery and a reminder about tunnel URLs), `doctor` (Check the local Shopify toolchain), `full-audit` (Run the full Shopify theme and app audit pass in one command)\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `PostToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install shopify-devkit@claude-community` from `mohitkale/shopify-devkit`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
